      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我并不是一帆风顺地走到今天的。\r\n一路上经历过下坡、也曾在泥泞中挣扎……真的经历了各种各样的挫折。",
      "source_fingerprint": "735a057f4cdb65953c075e794b515b5d93ad84fc0a9a286bcbc103e613ee5494",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
